<view class="pg10-page" style="padding-top: {{statusBarHeight}}px">
  <view class="pg10-header"><button class="pg10-back" bindtap="back" aria-label="返回">‹</button><view class="pg10-header-title">当前功能</view><view class="pg10-header-spacer"></view></view>
  <view class="pg10-card pg10-hero"><view class="pg10-kicker">PROJECT IRL · R1</view><view class="pg10-title">让一场真实活动顺利发生</view><view class="pg10-subtitle">本页按当前工程能力说明，不引用设计稿中尚不存在的版本号、上线日期或使用人数。</view></view>
  <view class="pg10-card"><view class="feature-icon">✧</view><view class="pg10-row-title">从想法到活动草稿</view><view class="pg10-note">一句话提取字段建议，主办方逐项核实时间、场地、费用、人数和规则，再保存草稿或发布。生产环境当前使用规则提取。</view></view>
  <view class="pg10-card"><view class="feature-icon violet">♧</view><view class="pg10-row-title">邀请报名与主办协作</view><view class="pg10-note">邀请活动经过人工审核后才能开放报名与分享。支持审批、预留名额、候补、协办权限和重大变更重新确认。</view></view>
  <view class="pg10-card"><view class="feature-icon green">✓</view><view class="pg10-row-title">现场签到与 AA 记录</view><view class="pg10-note">动态口令签到、人工补记确认、费用分摊与双方独立标记均有服务端记录；费用标记不代表真实付款凭证。</view></view>
  <view class="pg10-card"><view class="feature-icon red">◈</view><view class="pg10-row-title">安全和隐私入口</view><view class="pg10-note">站内通知、举报与申诉、屏蔽、本人数据导出与删除申请均可在当前小程序中操作。</view></view>
  <view class="pg10-card"><view class="pg10-row-title">仍未开放</view><view class="pg10-note">公开找局推荐、私聊、线上支付、自动订场、活动相册、勋章、真实 AI 语音建局与人工客服均不属于当前可用功能。</view></view>
  <button class="pg10-primary" bindtap="goCreate">发起一场受控活动</button><button class="secondary-action" bindtap="goActivities">查看我的活动</button>
</view>
